[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11641.91, "timestamp": "03:14:01", "text": "砰砰砰！不不不，我不是在说……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11643.349, "timestamp": "03:14:03", "text": "我之前说的那家酒吧就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11647.51, "timestamp": "03:14:07", "text": "除了……之外，还有一根细长的杆子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11650.15, "timestamp": "03:14:10", "text": "健康状态栏设计。我觉得不，不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11652.07, "timestamp": "03:14:12", "text": "不。但这并非设计初衷，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11655.83, "timestamp": "03:14:15", "text": "就像上次，呃，我之前看到的那场比赛。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11658.389, "timestamp": "03:14:18", "text": "我们当中只有一个人有那根酒吧和四个酒吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11661.349, "timestamp": "03:14:21", "text": "敌人有那个条形码，就像我没有一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11665.03, "timestamp": "03:14:25", "text": "知道它是什么。这是最终的吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11667.11, "timestamp": "03:14:27", "text": "找到匹配项？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11669.03, "timestamp": "03:14:29", "text": "这次我也会格外注意。是的。"}]